{"id":38,"event":"agent","data":{"type":"text_delta","delta":"The concept maps cleanly to a desktop-first inbox for file events: Ollaya proposes a destination or tag, while low-confidence/novel files are held for review rather than silently moved. I’m using the modern-minimal direction: a near-white neutral canvas, the direction’s blue accent, SF system typography, and a three-column watcher / event queue / decision trace layout that collapses for mobile. The prototype will label its event stream as a demo, so scripted examples are not mistaken for a live filesystem or live inference."},"timestamp":1790819423430}
